{
  "_comment_header": [
    "DevHub production realm — REFERENCE TEMPLATE for external Keycloak operations.",
    "",
    "본 파일은 git 추적되는 reference 다. 실제 운영 realm 은 사내 운영팀이 별도 관리하며",
    "본 저장소의 docker-compose.deploy.yml 은 본 파일을 자동 import 하지 않는다.",
    "운영팀은 본 파일을 export 자산으로 가져가 적용 후 환경별 수정 (DEVHUB_HOST 치환,",
    "client secret 발급, user federation 등) 을 수행한다.",
    "",
    "치환 placeholder:",
    "  __DEVHUB_HOST__               = devhub 외부 hostname (예: devhub.example.com)",
    "  __DEVHUB_BACKEND_SECRET__     = devhub-backend confidential client secret (운영팀 발급)",
    "",
    "관련 ADR / 문서:",
    "  - docs/adr/0018-single-port-reverse-proxy-policy.md",
    "  - docs/adr/0019-keycloak-only-idp.md",
    "  - docs/setup/keycloak_operations.md",
    "  - infra/idp/README.md §2.2 외부 Keycloak 모드"
  ],
  "id": "devhub",
  "realm": "devhub",
  "enabled": true,
  "displayName": "DevHub (production)",
  "eventsListeners": [ "jboss-logging", "devhub-event-listener" ],
  "sslRequired": "none",
  "registrationAllowed": false,
  "roles": {
    "realm": [
      { "name": "developer",     "description": "DevHub Developer Role" },
      { "name": "team_manager",       "description": "DevHub Manager Role" },
      { "name": "team_manager",   "description": "DevHub PMO Manager Role" },
      { "name": "system_admin",  "description": "DevHub System Administrator Role" }
    ]
  },
  "groups": [
    { "name": "devhub-developers",     "path": "/devhub-developers",     "realmRoles": [ "developer" ] },
    { "name": "devhub-managers",       "path": "/devhub-managers",       "realmRoles": [ "team_manager" ] },
    { "name": "devhub-pmo-managers",   "path": "/devhub-pmo-managers",   "realmRoles": [ "team_manager" ] },
    { "name": "devhub-system-admins",  "path": "/devhub-system-admins",  "realmRoles": [ "system_admin" ] }
  ],
  "clients": [
    {
      "clientId": "devhub-frontend",
      "enabled": true,
      "protocol": "openid-connect",
      "publicClient": true,
      "directAccessGrantsEnabled": false,
      "redirectUris": [
        "https://__DEVHUB_HOST__/devhub/auth/callback"
      ],
      "webOrigins": [
        "https://__DEVHUB_HOST__"
      ],
      "attributes": {
        "pkce.code.challenge.method": "S256",
        "post.logout.redirect.uris": "https://__DEVHUB_HOST__/devhub/##https://__DEVHUB_HOST__/devhub/login"
      },
      "protocolMappers": [
        {
          "name": "audience-mapper",
          "protocol": "openid-connect",
          "protocolMapper": "oidc-audience-mapper",
          "consentRequired": false,
          "config": {
            "included.client.audience": "devhub-frontend",
            "id.token.claim": "false",
            "access.token.claim": "true"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "employee_id",
          "protocol": "openid-connect",
          "protocolMapper": "oidc-usermodel-attribute-mapper",
          "consentRequired": false,
          "config": {
            "user.attribute": "employee_id",
            "id.token.claim": "true",
            "access.token.claim": "true",
            "claim.name": "employee_id",
            "jsonType.label": "String",
            "userinfo.token.claim": "true"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "clientId": "devhub-backend",
      "enabled": true,
      "protocol": "openid-connect",
      "publicClient": false,
      "secret": "__DEVHUB_BACKEND_SECRET__",
      "serviceAccountsEnabled": true,
      "directAccessGrantsEnabled": false,
      "authorizationServicesEnabled": false
    }
  ],
  "users": [
    {
      "username": "service-account-devhub-backend",
      "enabled": true,
      "serviceAccountClientId": "devhub-backend",
      "clientRoles": {
        "realm-management": [
          "view-users",
          "query-users",
          "view-events",
          "view-realm"
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
